---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Deep Learning Burn Scar Segmentation | {siteConfig.name}</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans">
    <Header />

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-grow">
      <a href="/portfolio/" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-medium mb-6 inline-block">
        ← Back to Portfolio
      </a>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">
        Deep Learning Burn Scar Semantic Segmentation
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Implemented a PyTorch U-Net convolutional neural network with a ResNet50 encoder and mixed-precision training on Sentinel-2 satellite imagery for automated burn scar segmentation and damage severity mapping.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700 mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-emerald-400">Model & Architecture Highlights</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>• <strong>Architecture:</strong> U-Net CNN with ResNet50 Backbone</li>
          <li>• <strong>Framework:</strong> PyTorch & Torchvision</li>
          <li>• <strong>Data Source:</strong> Sentinel-2 Multispectral Imagery (NIR / SWIR bands)</li>
          <li>• <strong>Optimization:</strong> Mixed-precision training with BCE + Dice Loss</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="my-8">
        <a 
          href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1-5YYkiePO7nM63A8NQ1MNigKVcbAoy8-?usp=sharing" 
          target="_blank" 
          class="inline-block bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          View Collab Notebook
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
